<div x-data="{ showVars: false }" class="mb-2">
    <button type="button" @click="showVars = !showVars"
            class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:text-slate-200 font-medium select-none">
        <svg x-bind:class="showVars ? 'rotate-90' : ''" class="w-3 h-3 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        Template variables &amp; shortcodes
    </button>
    <div x-show="showVars" x-cloak class="mt-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800/60 p-3 text-xs text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 space-y-1">
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 italic mb-1">Click any tag to insert it at cursor position.</p>
        <p><strong>Template variables:</strong></p>
        <p><code data-tag="[unsubscribe_url]" @click.stop="lpInsertVar($el.dataset.tag)" title="Click to insert" class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-600">[unsubscribe_url]</code> — Subscriber's unsubscribe link (required for compliance)</p>
        <p><code data-tag="[open_pixel]" @click.stop="lpInsertVar($el.dataset.tag)" title="Click to insert" class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-600">[open_pixel]</code> — Invisible 1×1 tracking pixel (place before &lt;/body&gt;)</p>
        <p><code data-tag="[email]" @click.stop="lpInsertVar($el.dataset.tag)" title="Click to insert" class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-600">[email]</code> — Subscriber's email address</p>
        <p><code data-tag="[subscriber_name]" @click.stop="lpInsertVar($el.dataset.tag)" title="Click to insert" class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-600">[subscriber_name]</code> — Subscriber's name (falls back to "Valued Customer")</p>
        <p><code data-tag="[subscriber_name|Hi there]" @click.stop="lpInsertVar($el.dataset.tag)" title="Click to insert" class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-600">[subscriber_name|Hi there]</code> — Subscriber's name with custom fallback after the <code class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm">|</code></p>
        <p class="pt-1 font-semibold">Coupon shortcodes (creates a unique coupon per subscriber on send):</p>
        <p><code data-tag='[generate_coupon discount_percent="10" prefix="SALE" expires_days="30" max_uses_per_email="1"]' @click.stop="lpInsertVar($el.dataset.tag)" title="Click to insert" class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-600">[generate_coupon discount_percent="10" prefix="SALE" expires_days="30" max_uses_per_email="1"]</code></p>
        <p><code data-tag='[generate_coupon discount_fixed="5" prefix="PROMO" expires_days="14"]' @click.stop="lpInsertVar($el.dataset.tag)" title="Click to insert" class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-600">[generate_coupon discount_fixed="5" prefix="PROMO" expires_days="14"]</code></p>
        <p><code data-tag='[generate_coupon discount_percent="10" prefix="SALE" for-email="[email]"]' @click.stop="lpInsertVar($el.dataset.tag)" title="Click to insert" class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-600">[generate_coupon discount_percent="10" prefix="SALE" for-email="[email]"]</code> — single-use, tied to subscriber</p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Attributes: <strong>discount_percent</strong> or <strong>discount_fixed</strong>, <strong>prefix</strong> (default: CAMP), <strong>expires_days</strong>, <strong>starts_at</strong> (optional, YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM), <strong>max_uses</strong>, <strong>max_uses_per_email</strong>, <strong>for-email</strong> (binds to a specific email, auto-sets max_uses=1). The coupon code is inserted in place of the tag.</p>
        <p class="pt-1 font-semibold">Content shortcodes:</p>
        <p><code data-tag='[latest_posts count="5" type="post" category="" tag=""]' @click.stop="lpInsertVar($el.dataset.tag)" title="Click to insert" class="bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 dark:text-slate-100 px-1 rounded-sm cursor-pointer hover:bg-slate-300 dark:hover:bg-slate-600">[latest_posts count="5" type="post" category="" tag=""]</code> — Display latest articles with images</p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Attributes: <strong>count</strong> (default 5), <strong>type</strong> (default post), <strong>category</strong> (slug, optional), <strong>tag</strong> (slug, optional, comma-separated for multiple tags, e.g. tag="news,offers"), <strong>lang</strong> (defaults to the campaign's sending language).</p>
    </div>
</div>
